# Gradebook filters and assignment deadlines

### Missing submission filter retains existing behavior — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/gradebook?type=ASSIGNMENT&reviewStatus=NOT_SUBMITTED&enrollmentStatus=ACTIVE&moduleId={{module_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

> {%
    client.test("Missing submission filter retains existing behavior", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200, got " + response.status);
        const row = response.body.students.content.find(x => String(x.studentId) === client.global.get("student_id"));
        client.assert(row != null, "Student with an unsubmitted assignment must match");
        client.assert(row.results.some(x => x.type === "ASSIGNMENT" && x.status === "NOT_SUBMITTED"));
    });
%}

### Future unsubmitted assignments are not overdue — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/gradebook?type=ASSIGNMENT&reviewStatus=OVERDUE&moduleId={{module_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{teacher_token}}

> {%
    client.test("Future unsubmitted assignments are not overdue", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200, got " + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.students.totalElements === 0);
        client.assert(response.body.students.content.length === 0);
        client.assert(response.body.totalColumns === 2);
    });
%}

### ADMIN may filter overdue assignments — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/{{course_id}}/gradebook?reviewStatus=OVERDUE
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

> {%
